Welcome to GrapheneDB!

At GrapheneDB we run Neo4j database instances as a service. We offer a straightforward and reliable hosting service,  so you can focus on building apps.

Getting Started

Log into your account at https://app.graphenedb.com using your email address and password to access your dashboard.

If you are just testing Neo4j or the GrapheneDB service, try our free Sandbox plan. Explore the capabilities of graph databases and test early versions of new apps.

Scale When You're Ready

We offer a range of database plans, suitable for every development stage. Choose the right levels of flexibility, support and reliability that your app needs. When your app is ready for production, our Standard and Performance plans offer scheduled backups, scalable storage and other features depending on your requirements.

Build From Existing Databases

Upgrade or downgrade your database plan with ease. In addition to creating new databases, our service allows you to clone existing databases and upgrade or downgrade them to the tiered plan that meets your needs.

Create a Database

What are you waiting for? View our plans and create your first database now.

Getting Help

You will find a getting started guide, an FAQ and additional resources in our developers area at http://docs.graphenedb.com.

GrapheneDB support can be contacted by visiting https://graphenedb.zendesk.com.

Looking forward to working with you,

The GrapheneDB Team.

