<p><b>Welcome to GrapheneDB!</b></p>

<p>At GrapheneDB we run Neo4j database instances as a service. We offer a straightforward and reliable hosting service,  so you can focus on building apps.</p>

<p><b>Getting Started</b></p>

<p>Log into your account at https://app.graphenedb.com using your email address and password to
access your dashboard.</p>

<p>If you are just testing Neo4j or the GrapheneDB service, <a href="https://app.graphenedb.com/dbs/manage/new">try our free Sandbox plan</a>. Explore the capabilities of graph databases and test early versions of new apps.</p>

<p><b>Scale When You&rsquo;re Ready</b></p>

<p>We offer a range of database plans, suitable for every development stage. Choose the right levels of flexibility, support and reliability that your app needs. When your app is ready for production, our <a href="https://app.graphenedb.com/dbs/manage/new">Standard and Performance plans</a> offer scheduled backups, scalable storage and other features depending on your requirements.</p>

<p><b>Build From Existing Databases</b></p>

<p>Upgrade or downgrade your database plan with ease. In addition to creating new databases, our service allows you to <a href="https://app.graphenedb.com/dbs/manage/clone">clone existing databases</a> and upgrade or downgrade them to the tiered plan that meets your needs.</p>

<p><b>Create a Database</b></p>

<p>What are you waiting for? View our plans and <a href="https://app.graphenedb.com/dbs/manage/new">create your first database now</a>.</p>

<p><b>Getting Help</b></p>

<p>You will find a getting started guide, an FAQ and additional resources in our developers area at http://docs.graphenedb.com.</p>

<p>GrapheneDB support can be contacted by visiting https://graphenedb.zendesk.com.</p>

<p>Looking forward to working with you,</p>

<p>The GrapheneDB Team.</p>

